<blockquote class="uncited"><div>In the settings, there’s a power setting. It’s default set at 4100 which is max. Goes down in 100 increments. How much drop in power is every drop of 100? GARY. N4KVE</div></blockquote>These values (100), are the raw DAC values that control the PA drive circuit, the amount of power difference for each step depends on a large number of factors e.g. Tx Frequency and battery voltage, and the gain of your specific PA FET in you radio.<br><br>It is not possible to specify how much change in output power there will be for each step change (100)<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sat Mar 22, 2025 11:50 pm</p><hr />
